    "body": "@ccmywish,\r\n\r\nas I commented on the posting, you could try the following (if you have the bash installed):\r\n\r\n```toml\r\nwhen = '[ \"$STARSHIP_SHELL\" == \"bash\" ]'\r\nshell = [\"bash\", \"--noprofile\", \"--norc\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat should be faster.",
