    "body": "I find using `custom` in PowerShell is slow as a whole.  This is because the startup time for PowerShell is quite slow even with default \"-noprofile\"\r\n\r\nTo prove this, I only preserve this configuration \r\n```toml\r\n[custom.pwsh]\r\ncommand = \"echo pwsh \"\r\nwhen = \"\"\" \"$env:STARSHIP_SHELL\" -eq \"powershell\" \"\"\"\r\nformat = \"$output\"\r\n```\r\nThis makes starship about 0.5 ~ 1 second obviously slower than usual. ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
