    "body": "We also have an [environment variable](https://starship.rs/config/#environment-variable) module for simply displaying environment variables. Since starship's (official) initscripts always set `$STARSHIP_SHELL`, you might be able to use that to figure out which shell is running.\r\n\r\n```\r\n[env_var]\r\nvariable = \"STARSHIP_SHELL\"\r\ndefault = \"unknown shell\"\r\n```",
